    {
      "id": "885819a9-0759-4915-ab63-0a54907baca7",
      "title": "MNI Deduplication (Senzing):",
      "subsections": [
        {
          "id": "d3acbabb-0d1c-4430-bd6a-0ee0cf392c69",
          "title": "",
          "bullets": [
            {
              "id": "5d358570-69f7-4574-876c-46615cb02111",
              "content": "<p>Completed approximately 95% of the MNI dedupe work, successfully processing roughly 430K MNIs. There are approximately 24K MNIs that have not yet been merged in the UI.</p>"
            },
            {
              "id": "6707d91c-ad34-4932-96c2-1245e8f2cfce",
              "content": "<p>At a high level, the remaining records appear to fall into a couple of scenarios:</p><ul><li>Some MNIs were already been merged into a different primary GUID than the one identified in the Senzing output</li><li>Some of the primary or duplicate GUIDs are associated with reports that are still In Progress or in Records Review, which may prevent the merge from completing.</li></ul>"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
